    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You've been out in the Tundra, haven't you? Did you come across any large structures? Well, those are used to help power Hutlar City and this outpost. They are designed to harvest the natural resources underneath the ice and process them into useable fuel. \n\nThey're largely automated but we need to constantly check on them and ensure they're running in tip-top shape. They're long overdue for a maintenance check.\n\nI had another off-worlder helping me maintain them but as it turns out, he was no match for the slugs that sucked him up. So now I'm in need of a new pair of hands. I know you can handle yourself out there so what do you say? Will you check on them for me?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Great. You need to check each power structure in a specific order. Start with the one in the southeast. Then go to the central one. Then north, southwest, and finally northwest. That's southeast, central, north, southwest, and northwest.\n\nEach node is dependent on the others so if you go out of order the tests won't be valid. I trust you can follow simple instructions, off-worlder? Yes? Very well, get going.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Remember to access the power structures in order: southeast, central, north, southwest, and finally northwest. I trust you can follow simple instructions, off-worlder.\n\nWhen you're done, come back to me for your payment.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": [
