      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Probably the damn Byysk. They steal anything they can get their hands on. [He reaches into his supply pack and pulls out an actuator.]\n\nI need you to head back out there and replace it. While you're there, kill a few Byysk for good measure.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
